exists su name author prompter ob text "Draft: be concise and friendly." be text ya
exists su name reviewer prompter ob text "Review the TASK and ANSWER. Return only PASS or FAIL." be text ya

exists su name author be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" accordingto name author prompter ya
exists su name reviewer be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" accordingto name reviewer prompter ya

exists su name task ob text "Write a short greeting." be text ya

su name reviewer try ob name text task to name text output be ceremony def
su name sketch out ob name task for name author to name text sketch out by num 0 be write do
exists su name reviewer input ob text "TASK:\n" be text ya
ob name task to name reviewer input be plus do
ob text "\nANSWER:\n" to name reviewer input be plus do
ob name sketch out to name reviewer input be plus do
su name criticism out ob name text reviewer input for name reviewer to name text criticism out by num 0 be write do

ob name criticism out from text "PASS" be equally then
exists su name decision out ob text "" be text ya
ob name criticism out from text "PASS" be equally then
ob name sketch out to name decision out be plus do

ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
exists su name better input ob text "TASK:\n" be text ya
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
ob name task to name better input be plus do
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
ob text "\nANSWER:\n" to name better input be plus do
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
ob name sketch out to name better input be plus do
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
ob text "\nCRITICISM:\n" to name better input be plus do
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
ob name criticism out to name better input be plus do
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
su name better out ob name text better input for name author to name text better out by num 0 be write do
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
exists su name decision out ob text "" be text ya
ob name criticism out from text "FAIL" be equally then
ob name better out to name decision out be plus do

su name decision out ret
prah

ob name text task to name text output be reviewer try do
ob name output be write do
